  m_Name: RankExplanation
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: TowerDefence.Battlefield::TowerDefence.Battlefield.TutorialDefinition
  Id: RankExplanation
  Title: How Navy ranks work
  Pages:
  - Earn EXP to progress through Seaman, Petty Officer, Lieutenant, Commander, and
    Admiral. The dashboard shows your progress and the next EXP threshold.
  - Higher ranks unlock structures and upgrade tiers. Money buys structures and repairs;
    Upgrade Points are a separate balance used by advanced upgrades.
